; A reduction with a cost spec books only against lots held at cost; units
; held without cost in the same account are never matched.
2006-01-01 open Assets:Stock "FIFO"
2006-01-01 open Assets:Strict
2006-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2006-01-02 * "Buy at cost"
  Assets:Stock   1 HOOL {10 USD}
  Assets:Strict  1 HOOL {10 USD}
  Assets:Cash

2006-01-03 * "Buy at cost"
  Assets:Stock   1 HOOL {12 USD}
  Assets:Cash

2006-01-04 * "Units without cost"
  Assets:Stock   1 HOOL @ 10 USD
  Assets:Strict  3 HOOL @ 10 USD
  Assets:Cash

2006-01-05 * "Sell across the cost lots under FIFO"
  Assets:Stock  -2 HOOL {}
  Assets:Cash   22 USD

2006-01-06 * "STRICT: the single cost lot is unambiguous"
  Assets:Strict -1 HOOL {}
  Assets:Cash   10 USD

2006-01-07 balance Assets:Stock   1 HOOL
2006-01-07 balance Assets:Strict  3 HOOL
